    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16483" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστεργ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without love, implacable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀργή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					776
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τι παθεῖν</span> something
				<i>intolerable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>OT</u>
				229
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>repellent,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Gland.</u>
				16
			</span></i>; <i>unyielding,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστερον ξύλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fract.</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			 (s.v.l.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				49.28.3
			</span></i>.</div>
